## 2. Restrictions

You may NOT:

- Use these RFCs for commercial purposes without a separate commercial license
- Remove or alter any copyright, trademark, or patent notices
- Republish or redistribute these RFCs without permission
- Create derivative RFC specifications without permission
- Create competing standards based on these RFCs
- Use the "RFC-PCS" prefix for your own specifications
- Modify RFCs and claim the modified version is an official PCS specification
- Claim that your implementation is "PCS-compliant" or "PCS-certified" without passing PCS-CTS and obtaining certification

