Exocortical Concepts, Inc. reserves the right to submit PCS RFCs to standards development organizations (SDOs) such as IETF, W3C, ISO/IEC JTC 1, or others.

Any such submission will be accompanied by appropriate IP disclosures and licensing commitments.

